OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,6,Fmorning inland. Rather cloudy and
OL,7,Fbreezy over the Western Isles at first
OL,8,Fbut brightening up through the
OL,9,Fmorning. Clouding over from the
OL,10,Fsoutheast through the afternoon,
OL,11,Fstaying bright with sunny spells in
OL,12,Fthe northwest.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear spells at first in the
OL,15,Fnorthwest. Otherwise largely cloudy
OL,16,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,17,Fa few outbreaks of patchy light rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
