OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy and unsettled
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain, mostly light
OL,7,Fat first but becoming heavier and more
OL,8,Fpersistent through the day. Breezy
OL,9,Faround the coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FUnsettled on Wednesday with cloud and
OL,13,Frain at times. Sunny intervals and
OL,14,Fshowers on Thursday. Chance of turning
OL,15,Frather wet and windy on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
